摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"You.com skills and plugins for web search, content extraction, research, finance, and integration discovery, helping AI agents build with up-to-date web context.","id":"gh:1142838994","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"agent-skills","slug":"youdotcom-oss/agent-skills","topics":["agent-plugins","agent-skills","ai-agents","claude-code","codex","cordis","cursor","dsh","dsh-plugin","github-copilot-cli","integration-discovery","kimi-code","mcp","mcp-server","openclaw","opencode","web-fetch","web-search","youdotcom"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"You.com skills and plugins for web search, content extraction, research, finance, and integration di"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"scovery, helping AI agents build with up-to-date web context."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# You.com Web Search & Research"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Give Claude live access to the web. This plugin adds You.com search, full-page content extraction, a"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"nd cited multi-source research to Claude, so answers about fast-moving libraries, APIs, tools, and m"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"arkets come from current sources instead of stale training data. Every answer cites the pages it rea"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"kets come from current sources instead of stale training data. Every answer cites the pages it read."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What you can do"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Search the live web**: find current information, news, pricing, and facts, then read the actual "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"pages before answering.\n- **Pull web data into your work**: extract clean Markdown, HTML, or metadat"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"a from any public URL, including docs pages, tables, and reports.\n- **Code with current docs**: look"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" up the latest library docs, API references, changelogs, breaking changes, package versions, and fix"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"es for error messages while you build.\n- **Research with citations**: compare frameworks, evaluate t"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ools and vendors, or produce a deep-dive report synthesized from many sources.\n- **Research companie"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"s and markets**: get stock prices, earnings, and company financials.\n- **Build with You.com**: find "},{"id":"p5s8","text":"the right You.com API, MCP server, or SDK path for your own app or agent."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Example prompts:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install in Claude Code"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Basic web search works without an account through the free MCP profile. For full search, content ext"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"raction, research, and finance, sign in with OAuth when prompted or set an API key from you.com/plat"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"rch, and finance, sign in with OAuth when prompted or set an API key from you.com/platform/api-keys."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What this plugin connects to"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The plugin contains skills and remote MCP server configs only. It has no hooks and starts no local M"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"CP servers or scripts. When a skill runs, Claude sends your search queries, the URLs you ask it to r"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ead, and research or finance questions to You.com's MCP servers:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- `https://api.you.com/mcp` (search, contents, discovery; `?profile=free` for keyless search)\n- `htt"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ps://api.you.com/mcp/research` (research)\n- `https://api.you.com/mcp/finance` (finance)\n- `https://y"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ou.com/docs/_mcp/server` (You.com docs search, used by `you-discover`)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requests are handled under the You.com privacy policy. Web pages and search results are treated as u"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ntrusted data, never as instructions."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Skills"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Skill          | Use it for |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `you-web`      | Live web search plus full-page reading, with a citation-first pipeline. |\n| `you-"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"research` | Multi-source research, routed between agent-led search and one-shot cited synthesis. |\n|"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" `you-finance`  | Stock, earnings, and company financial questions through the `you-finance` MCP too"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"l. |\n| `you-discover` | Finding how to integrate You.com APIs, MCP servers, SDKs, and docs into your"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"cover` | Finding how to integrate You.com APIs, MCP servers, SDKs, and docs into your own project. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Other agent platforms"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The same skills are packaged for Cursor, Codex, GitHub Copilot CLI, Kimi Code, Grok Build, OpenCode,"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" OpenClaw, Pi, Hermes, and DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Start Here"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install the shared skills with the universal Agent Skills installer:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Then ask your agent to use the right skill:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Install one skill at a time if you only need a subset:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Install for Your Platform"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Platform                        | Install path                                                    "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"                                      |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Agent Skills compatible clients | `npx skills add youdotcom-oss/agent-skills`                     "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"                                      |\n| Claude Code                     | `/plugin marketplace add"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" youdotcom-oss/agent-skills` then `/plugin install you@you-com`               |\n| GitHub Copilot CLI"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"              | `copilot plugin marketplace add youdotcom-oss/agent-skills` then `copilot plugin ins"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"tall you@you-com` |\n| Codex                           | `codex plugin marketplace add youdotcom-oss/"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"agent-skills --sparse .agents/plugins`                    |\n| Cursor                          | Inst"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"all this repository from the Cursor plugin UI or CLI                                              |\n"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"| Kimi Code                       | `/plugins install <repo url>`                                   "},{"id":"p29s9","text":"                                      |\n| Grok Build                      | `grok plugin marketplace"},{"id":"p29s10","text":" add youdotcom-oss/agent-skills` then `grok plugin install you --trust`       |\n| OpenCode 2        "},{"id":"p29s11","text":"              | `opencode plugin add @youdotcom-oss/opencode`                                       "},{"id":"p29s12","text":"                  |\n| OpenClaw                        | `openclaw plugins install clawhub:you` or `o"},{"id":"p29s13","text":"penclaw plugins install npm:@youdotcom-oss/openclaw`      |\n| Pi                              | `pi "},{"id":"p29s14","text":"install npm:@youdotcom-oss/pi`                                                                    |\n"},{"id":"p29s15","text":"| Hermes                          | `hermes plugins install youdotcom-oss/agent-skills`             "},{"id":"p29s16","text":"                                                           |\n| DeepSeek Harness                | `ds"},{"id":"p29s17","text":"h plugin --profile web add @youdotcom-oss/dsh-plugin`                                              |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The top-level plugin manifests reuse the shared `skills/` directory when the host supports it. Packa"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ges under `packages/` include host-specific metadata, copied skills, or runtime adapters where neede"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"s under `packages/` include host-specific metadata, copied skills, or runtime adapters where needed."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Configure You.com MCP servers"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Core remote MCP endpoints:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Endpoint                           | Use it for                      |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `https://api.you.com/mcp`          | Authenticated You.com MCP tools |\n| `https://you.com/docs/_mc"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"p/server` | You.com docs search             |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For clients that use API-key headers:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Get an API key at you.com/platform/api-keys."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Useful tool profiles:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Endpoint                                    | Use it for                      |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
